# Line endings
#
# Every text file in this repository is stored and checked out with LF
# endings, on every platform. This is not cosmetic: the dataset's format
# contract specifies LF, `scripts/mpb_corpus.py check` enforces it, and any
# published checksum assumes it. Without the rules below, a clone on Windows
# converts the CSVs to CRLF, the check then fails and the checksums do not
# match — through no fault of the person verifying them.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Be explicit for the dataset itself rather than relying on auto-detection.
*.csv   text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.py    text eol=lf
*.ipynb text eol=lf
*.toml  text eol=lf
*.lock  text eol=lf

# Binary: never transformed, never diffed as text.
*.pdf binary
